# the Roman and late-antique world and its edges (Boudica, Hadrian's Wall, Vindolanda, Plague of Cyprian, Cai Lun, Nicaea, Apollonius, Simon Magus, Thomas in India, Lady of Cao, Attila, sack of Rome 410);
# modern myths, doomsdays and pathological science (Georgia Guidestones, Montauk, dogu, polywater, Vulcan, Nibiru, Y2K, Owlman, Men in Black, Slender Man, Heitsi-eibib, Lost City of the Kalahari, Kruger Millions, Daedalus sea serpent, aswang, tikbalang)
